-- BAD TUPLE ------------------------------ src/NativePreviewProposalIngress.elm

I only accept tuples with two or three items. This has too many:

79|             (D.map6 (\protocol kind domain ordinal advisory wire -> (protocol,kind,domain,ordinal,advisory,wire))
                                                                        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
I recommend switching to records. Each item will be named, and you can use the
`point.x` syntax to access them.

Note: Read <https://elm-lang.org/0.19.2/tuples> for more comprehensive advice on
working with large chunks of data in Elm.

